YARP Docs - Third-Party Content Notice
=======================================

The documentation content served by this application (everything under
yarp-docs/content/ and compiled to yarp-docs/public/assets/mock-api/v1/) is
adapted from Microsoft's YARP documentation on Microsoft Learn:

  https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/aspnet/core/fundamentals/servers/yarp/

